OL,3,GNEWSAWill Posh fans welcome Robbie
OL,4,ASavage as boss?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterborough United fans are undecided
OL,7,Fas to whether prospective manager
OL,8,FRobbie Savage is the right person for
OL,9,Fthe job.
OL,11,FSavage's current National League club
OL,12,FForest Green Rovers said on Tuesday the
OL,13,Fformer Wales international had been
OL,14,Foffered the job, which the League One
OL,15,Fside has not yet confirmed.
OL,17,FPosh fan Stuart Killingray said a
OL,18,F"celebrity" signing felt like "an odd
OL,19,Fchoice" at first, but that his
OL,20,Fexperience as a player could be useful.
